sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant R as Ring
    participant DEAD as Node C (down)
    participant D as Node D (successor)

    GW->>R: lookup key K
    R-->>GW: primary was Node C
    GW->>DEAD: read K
    DEAD--xGW: timeout
    GW->>D: read K from successor
    D-->>GW: value (replica)
    GW-->>C: 200 OK
